Revision history for Geo-Postcodes-NO

1.00 2026-07-28
    - Reimplemented Geo::Postcodes::NO as a self-contained module backed by
      Bring's postcode register.
    - Replaces the historical Geo::Postcodes::NO 0.31 implementation and folds
      in the relevant Geo::Postcodes 0.32 base-class behaviour.
    - Folded the old Geo::Postcodes selection helpers into Geo::Postcodes::NO.
    - Added local bundled postcode data, runtime data-file override, and
      runtime data-encoding override.
    - Bundled postcode data is the Bring register valid from 2026-10-01
      (5112 postcodes).
    - Added check-postcodes-no for validating user-supplied Bring files.
    - Added mathematical nand selection and oldnand compatibility modes.
    - Added Tutorial and Selection POD documentation and example programs in
      the eg/ directory.
